<section class="cta" id="cta">
  <div class="wrap cta-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>The next step</span>
    <h2>
      Give your team the <em>orchestration platform</em>.
    </h2>
    <p>
      Twenty minutes with a solutions architect. We'll model the substrate against your data, your governance posture, and the first app your team would ship on it.
    </p>
    <div class="row">
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">
        Talk to a solutions architect <span class="arr">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:founders@assembly-industries.com" class="btn btn-secondary">
        Email founders@assembly-industries.com
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="promise">
      <span>Single-tenant deploy</span>
      <span>Customer-isolated inference</span>
      <span>SOC 2 Type II · no lock-in</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    padding: 140px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
    background:
      radial-gradient(800px 400px at 50% 0%, var(--color-lavender-50), transparent 70%),
      #fff;
    position: relative;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .cta .eyebrow { justify-content: center; }
  .cta h2 {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px);
  }
  .cta h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
  }
  .cta p {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    max-width: 540px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .row {
    margin-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .promise {
    margin-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 30px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .promise span::before {
    content: "›";
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
    margin-right: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
